WEBVTT

01:36.450 --> 01:41.130
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.390 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 35]

01:48.350 --> 01:50.680
Then raise your heads and see clearly

01:51.520 --> 01:53.720
who your true Heavenly King really is.

01:55.520 --> 01:56.190
But...

01:59.500 --> 02:01.140
[Endless Plains, Northern Wasteland]

02:01.190 --> 02:02.960
[Cai Qishen, Flame Lord]

02:01.480 --> 02:04.340
I pledge to follow you, Heavenly King,
to the death.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.000
The Twelve Serial Docks

02:06.710 --> 02:08.590
were originally as close as a family.

02:08.590 --> 02:11.320
Heavenly King,
you've looked after our families

02:11.750 --> 02:14.390
and allowed us to enjoy the pinnacle
of the martial world,

02:14.390 --> 02:15.750
gaining both fame and wealth.

02:15.750 --> 02:17.280
This is truly our blessing.

02:20.360 --> 02:22.430
We pledge to follow the Heavenly King
to the death!

02:22.430 --> 02:25.230
We pledge to follow the Heavenly King
to the death!

02:41.710 --> 02:43.079
If this plan succeeds,

02:43.670 --> 02:44.870
your future identity

02:45.560 --> 02:47.020
could be Constable Tieyi,

02:47.590 --> 02:48.800
Xiao Kaiyan,

02:49.710 --> 02:50.470
or perhaps

02:51.640 --> 02:53.360
even the Imperial Advisor.

02:55.560 --> 02:56.960
Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:57.610 --> 03:01.070
Wu Jie is determined to
fight against the Northern Wasteland.

03:01.370 --> 03:03.100
The pro-war faction in the court

03:03.100 --> 03:04.760
all look to him as their model.

03:05.150 --> 03:07.420
I've summoned him back to the capital
many times to defend the state.

03:07.420 --> 03:09.360
What I seek is peace
and an end to the war.

03:09.360 --> 03:12.160
This is all for the sake of
Daxi's state and people.

03:12.860 --> 03:13.660
I believe

03:14.670 --> 03:17.730
the people will surely understand
my good intentions.

03:18.280 --> 03:20.720
It's a great blessing
for the people of Daxi

03:21.520 --> 03:24.320
to have a sovereign
as benevolent as Your Majesty.

03:24.360 --> 03:26.960
Your Majesty need only continue
sending edicts to the Immortal Pass,

03:26.960 --> 03:29.380
commanding Wu Jie to return to
the capital without delay.

03:29.380 --> 03:30.670
I've already stationed a sizable force

03:30.670 --> 03:32.480
in ambush along his route back.

03:32.870 --> 03:34.329
We'll surely capture him.

03:37.050 --> 03:38.329
You mean

03:38.800 --> 03:40.530
if Wu Jie falls into your hands,

03:40.750 --> 03:42.680
the soldiers at the Immortal Pass
will surely

03:42.680 --> 03:44.560
fear the Northern Wasteland Army
breaking through

03:44.560 --> 03:45.540
and won't dare speak out.

03:45.540 --> 03:48.540
Then Wu Jie will appear to be
ignoring imperial orders

03:48.710 --> 03:50.440
and openly defying the throne.

03:51.030 --> 03:51.680
Am I right?

03:52.280 --> 03:55.540
The determination of our soldiers and
the people to resist

03:55.630 --> 03:58.520
the Northern Wasteland
is Your Majesty's greatest obstacle now.

03:58.520 --> 03:59.470
Using this matter

03:59.470 --> 04:01.410
to discourage the soldiers
and court officials

04:01.410 --> 04:03.540
from their resolve to resist the north

04:03.710 --> 04:05.520
will not only appease
the Northern Wasteland,

04:05.520 --> 04:07.960
but can also ultimately
pave the way for peace.

04:07.960 --> 04:10.420
It'll be killing three birds
with one stone.

04:12.800 --> 04:13.360
Good.

04:13.870 --> 04:14.590
Brilliant.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.339
Excellent.

04:17.860 --> 04:20.440
What a brilliant
three-birds-with-one-stone plan.

04:20.440 --> 04:23.270
At this moment,
I truly wish to honor you as

04:24.160 --> 04:25.420
the Imperial Advisor.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.850
I wouldn't dare, Your Majesty.

04:30.360 --> 04:30.920
Alright.

04:31.810 --> 04:33.409
Wu Jie has served with merit.

04:33.950 --> 04:36.210
If one day he truly falls into your hands,

04:36.390 --> 04:38.190
there's no need for punishment.

04:38.830 --> 04:41.560
Just let him return to his hometown
with honor.

04:42.920 --> 04:43.560
Yes.

04:45.830 --> 04:47.430
So what do you think, Senior?

04:51.360 --> 04:53.120
As long as you help our Northern Wasteland

04:53.120 --> 04:55.650
seize the fertile lands
of the Central Plains

04:55.750 --> 04:58.159
and fulfill your promise

04:58.310 --> 05:01.640
to give the three of us
the Voidheart Codex once this is done,

05:03.350 --> 05:06.280
we couldn't care less about
who the Heavenly King is.

05:07.890 --> 05:09.630
Everything's falling into place.

05:09.630 --> 05:11.560
You've all earned your share of
the credit,

05:11.560 --> 05:12.360
so of course,

05:13.100 --> 05:14.630
the perks won't be missing.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.310
Qiushui,

05:18.700 --> 05:20.460
I'll make you kneel before me

05:20.950 --> 05:22.350
and admit you were wrong.

05:22.830 --> 05:25.430
When all's said and done,
victory will be mine.

05:37.750 --> 05:38.610
Show yourself.

05:41.450 --> 05:42.180
Big Brother,

05:42.510 --> 05:43.310
are you awake?

05:44.190 --> 05:45.920
Many martial sects have arrived outside,

05:45.920 --> 05:49.180
all waiting to discuss matters with you,
Alliance Leader.

05:52.480 --> 05:54.310
He should be awake by now.

05:54.800 --> 05:56.000
Didn't Xueyu say

05:56.000 --> 05:57.580
Big Brother's injuries
were no longer serious?

05:57.580 --> 05:58.409
Yes, she did.

06:01.190 --> 06:01.920
Big Brother?

06:17.560 --> 06:18.310
Crazy Yan.

06:19.390 --> 06:20.450
What's this about?

06:21.750 --> 06:23.240
Need to pee?

06:24.280 --> 06:26.430
Hold on. We'll be there soon.

06:30.520 --> 06:32.320
Where exactly are you taking me?

06:33.780 --> 06:34.780
Let me go first.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.560
If you have something to say,

06:36.560 --> 06:37.760
we can talk properly.

06:38.600 --> 06:40.060
I've already subdued you.

06:40.360 --> 06:43.159
Do you think I still need to
talk properly with you?

06:45.630 --> 06:47.950
When the 16 major sects
besieged me back then,

06:47.950 --> 06:50.350
they didn't talk properly with me, either.

06:50.870 --> 06:53.000
Besides, you're as stubborn as a mule.

06:53.840 --> 06:55.240
Good thing I'm in a hurry.

06:56.560 --> 06:58.920
Isn't this more efficient?

07:00.360 --> 07:04.690
Senior, you've been in seclusion for years
since the Wuxing Mountain battle.

07:04.750 --> 07:06.560
Your return to the martial world this time

07:06.560 --> 07:08.330
must be for some unfinished business.

07:08.330 --> 07:10.790
As long as you're not up to
anything immoral,

07:12.120 --> 07:13.320
I agree to go with you.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.630
As expected, I wasn't wrong about you.

07:16.630 --> 07:18.230
Worthy of being my disciple.

07:18.560 --> 07:19.690
You do have courage.

07:29.270 --> 07:32.470
It's not in vain
that I brought you here specially.

07:35.200 --> 07:35.909
So, Senior,

07:37.070 --> 07:38.130
where are we going?

07:39.510 --> 07:40.190
Wudang,

07:40.680 --> 07:41.340
just ahead.

07:46.600 --> 07:47.430
I wonder

07:48.040 --> 07:50.310
why you want to go to Wudang, Senior.

07:50.870 --> 07:54.480
To persuade Wudang and Shaolin
to merge their martial skills.

07:58.510 --> 08:01.160
The Northern Wasteland
is now eyeing us covetously.

08:01.160 --> 08:04.490
Each sect in the Daxi martial world
harbors its own schemes,

08:04.830 --> 08:07.070
and on top of that, some villains
even colluded with the Northern Wasteland,

08:07.070 --> 08:10.070
resulting in heavy casualties
among the major sects.

08:10.830 --> 08:12.600
If we want to restore glory

08:13.680 --> 08:15.680
to the martial world within 10 years,

08:15.680 --> 08:16.880
there's only one way:

08:18.870 --> 08:20.800
persuade Wudang and Shaolin

08:21.270 --> 08:23.000
to set aside their differences

08:23.560 --> 08:27.270
and combine the martial skills
of the two sects together.

08:27.950 --> 08:29.880
Only then can mastery be achieved.

08:30.240 --> 08:31.430
Then, those skills
should be spread widely,

08:31.430 --> 08:33.760
so all righteous warriors can learn them.

08:34.549 --> 08:36.950
There will be no more barriers
among sects.

08:37.539 --> 08:39.200
With unity in the martial world,

08:39.200 --> 08:42.659
we can surely stand against
the Northern Wasteland together.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.880
Your intentions are truly noble, Senior.

08:47.720 --> 08:50.550
This concerns the fate
of the entire martial world.

08:50.550 --> 08:52.410
It's just that Shaolin and Wudang

08:53.320 --> 08:55.150
won't be easily persuaded.

08:55.550 --> 08:58.790
At this moment, Shaolin's new abbot
is visiting Wudang.

08:59.970 --> 09:01.900
We must not miss this opportunity.

09:18.510 --> 09:19.970
At the Heroes' Gathering,

09:20.180 --> 09:22.400
you exposed Ji Wupeng's true identity,

09:20.350 --> 09:22.780
[New Leader of Wudang Sect, Dafeng]
[New Abbot of Shaolin Sect, Tianxiang]

09:22.770 --> 09:24.430
rid the martial world of evil,

09:24.630 --> 09:26.870
and prevented us from being deceived

09:26.870 --> 09:29.320
by that unforgivable criminal
of the martial world.

09:29.320 --> 09:32.360
We're grateful for that, Senior.

09:34.720 --> 09:37.480
But may I ask what brings you

09:38.150 --> 09:39.390
here today, Senior?

09:40.000 --> 09:41.860
Back then, Tianzheng and Taichan

09:42.870 --> 09:44.930
possessed such courage and majesty.

09:46.080 --> 09:47.320
But since those two,

09:47.670 --> 09:50.600
none of you have shown any real ability
to make a mark.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.410
If you don't unite soon,

09:55.510 --> 09:57.370
disaster will surely befall you.

09:59.870 --> 10:00.800
Today, I've come

10:01.510 --> 10:02.710
to deliver a message,

10:04.030 --> 10:06.490
to convey
what Tianzheng and Taichan wished

10:08.240 --> 10:10.030
to you younger generations.

10:11.030 --> 10:13.090
From now on, Wudang's martial skills

10:13.590 --> 10:15.190
must be shared with Shaolin,

10:15.510 --> 10:16.790
and Shaolin's martial skills

10:16.790 --> 10:18.590
must also be shared with Wudang.

10:19.290 --> 10:22.480
Only by doing so
can this great calamity be averted.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.200
This...

10:26.320 --> 10:28.550
Shaolin's martial skills
are profound and extensive.

10:28.550 --> 10:30.320
I often seek guidance
from Master Tianxiang

10:30.320 --> 10:32.980
on Shaolin's
external martial arts techniques

10:33.030 --> 10:34.510
and have benefited greatly.

10:34.510 --> 10:37.910
However, combining
different martial arts styles together

10:38.080 --> 10:40.320
is a major taboo for martial artists.

10:41.670 --> 10:42.910
Shaolin is Shaolin,

10:43.240 --> 10:44.480
and Wudang is Wudang.

10:45.030 --> 10:47.630
The two sects can join forces
against enemies,

10:47.790 --> 10:49.480
but no matter how friendly we are,

10:49.480 --> 10:52.320
we would never exchange martial skills.

10:52.340 --> 10:53.030
Nonsense!

10:53.480 --> 10:55.080
The true taboo in martial cultivation

10:55.080 --> 10:58.580
is working in isolation, refusing to adapt
and narrow-mindedness.

10:58.580 --> 10:59.840
Wudang's martial arts

11:00.240 --> 11:02.150
value internal cultivation,

11:02.910 --> 11:05.570
while Shaolin focuses on
external techniques.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.200
Together, you two sects

11:07.320 --> 11:08.720
can learn from each other

11:08.980 --> 11:10.720
and become each other's greatest aid.

11:10.720 --> 11:13.630
You want Shaolin to learn techniques
from Wudang?

11:14.120 --> 11:14.660
No.

11:15.030 --> 11:16.070
Never!

11:16.550 --> 11:17.480
Never?

11:18.120 --> 11:19.250
Then make your move.

11:24.340 --> 11:25.000
Senior Yan.

11:25.550 --> 11:26.770
We're here to mediate,

11:26.770 --> 11:27.650
not to fight.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.730
Watch carefully from the side.

11:33.480 --> 11:36.210
This is what
true martial arts fusion looks like.

11:41.900 --> 11:42.700
Watch my move!

11:48.550 --> 11:51.480
Shaolin's ultimate technique,
the Great Hand Seal.

12:15.270 --> 12:17.070
This is our Wudang Sect's skill,

12:17.550 --> 12:19.150
the Canhe Finger Technique.

12:20.590 --> 12:21.450
How about that?

12:22.200 --> 12:23.350
Wudang plus Shaolin

12:24.000 --> 12:26.840
is much stronger than
either one alone, isn't it?

12:27.270 --> 12:28.720
Amitabha.

12:29.240 --> 12:31.650
There are always greater people
and higher powers beyond.

12:31.650 --> 12:32.130
Senior,

12:32.470 --> 12:34.080
I'm enlightened.

12:38.630 --> 12:41.760
I'd also like to request
some guidance from you, Senior.

12:44.120 --> 12:45.780
You're not convinced either?

12:47.030 --> 12:47.760
Come on then.

12:49.320 --> 12:50.250
Draw your sword.

12:54.590 --> 12:55.920
I can conserve my energy

12:55.980 --> 12:58.380
and still converse with you effortlessly.

13:04.630 --> 13:05.840
Being a hero is about righteousness.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.350
It means even though you know
you shouldn't do something,

13:07.350 --> 13:08.750
you still do it out of righteousness.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.320
Helping the weak

13:09.320 --> 13:10.510
with one's own strength

13:10.510 --> 13:11.440
makes one a hero.

13:11.870 --> 13:14.870
And one who inspires
thousands of heroes to uphold justice

13:14.870 --> 13:16.800
deserves to be called a great hero.

13:16.870 --> 13:18.240
Can your Wudang's internal energy

13:18.240 --> 13:19.370
achieve this level?

13:24.080 --> 13:26.240
Only by learning from others' strengths
to make up for your own weaknesses

13:26.240 --> 13:29.040
can you escape the limits of
a narrow perspective.

13:49.550 --> 13:51.610
Which technique did I employ just now

13:51.770 --> 13:53.370
when I struck your acupoint?

13:53.720 --> 13:56.720
It's Wudang's 39 Bridges
with Unified Nod technique.

13:57.150 --> 14:00.410
With elements borrowed from
Shaolin's staff techniques.

14:07.000 --> 14:07.860
I admit defeat.

14:08.030 --> 14:09.320
Even if I drew my sword,

14:09.510 --> 14:11.440
I would be no match for you, Senior.

14:13.840 --> 14:14.570
Please rise.

14:16.510 --> 14:17.570
Thank you, Senior.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.330
Given your current position,

14:20.870 --> 14:22.530
you accept defeat gracefully

14:22.670 --> 14:24.670
without a single word of complaint.

14:25.000 --> 14:27.910
The Wudang and Shaolin Sects
truly produce exceptional talents.

14:27.910 --> 14:28.870
Given time,

14:30.030 --> 14:32.890
you'll surely be on par with
Tianzheng and Taichan.

14:34.030 --> 14:35.910
We juniors have yet to train enough.

14:35.910 --> 14:39.370
If the leaders of Shaolin
and our sect were still around today,

14:40.200 --> 14:42.930
I believe
they wouldn't disappoint you, Senior.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.810
If those two were still around,

14:45.240 --> 14:47.840
they surely wouldn't be
as stubborn as you are.

14:49.310 --> 14:51.040
What exactly are you thinking?

14:51.900 --> 14:53.240
Do you really want others

14:53.240 --> 14:55.870
to master and combine
your two sects' techniques first

14:55.870 --> 14:58.070
before you finally come to your senses?

14:58.270 --> 15:01.790
Shaolin and Wudang Sects' martial skills
are profound and extensive.

15:01.790 --> 15:02.830
In this world,

15:03.080 --> 15:04.880
besides you, Senior,

15:05.000 --> 15:07.260
who else could possibly master them all?

15:09.670 --> 15:10.320
Senior,

15:11.320 --> 15:13.380
aren't you worrying unnecessarily?

15:13.480 --> 15:15.360
It's beyond unnecessary worry.

15:15.870 --> 15:17.870
It's complete nonsense.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.630
It's beyond nonsense.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.510
It's completely delusional.

15:31.120 --> 15:33.150
It's beyond delusion.

15:33.840 --> 15:36.030
It's absolute rubbish.

15:41.120 --> 15:42.650
Who would have thought that

15:42.840 --> 15:44.670
the three masters of Wudang Sect,

15:44.670 --> 15:46.480
Jiusheng, Jiusi, and Jiuyi,

15:46.910 --> 15:48.080
actually survived?

15:49.320 --> 15:52.780
And you're even living a leisurely life
here in the mountains.

15:53.870 --> 15:55.320
Not just the three of us.

15:56.030 --> 15:58.890
Shaolin's five monks: Feng, Hua, Xue,
Yue, and Can.

15:59.030 --> 16:00.890
They also survived, didn't they?

16:01.320 --> 16:04.580
It seems quite a few masters
from both sects have survived.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.510
It's just that I wonder
if you three still remember

16:07.510 --> 16:09.030
our battle from years ago.

16:09.390 --> 16:10.990
Of course we still remember.

16:11.240 --> 16:13.320
Back then, the three of us

16:13.910 --> 16:15.790
were indeed defeated by you.

16:16.910 --> 16:20.310
But when it comes to the martial skills
of Shaolin and Wudang,

16:20.320 --> 16:22.790
you, Mr. Yan, may not necessarily

16:23.000 --> 16:24.600
be a match for the three of us.

16:25.080 --> 16:26.610
Words alone prove nothing.

16:27.030 --> 16:28.430
Why not put it to the test?

16:29.790 --> 16:31.790
It's been a long time since we've fought.

16:31.790 --> 16:34.080
I'm afraid that in the days to come,

16:34.440 --> 16:37.300
there will be no opponent
worthy of us making a move.

16:53.550 --> 16:54.320
Senior Yan!

17:15.200 --> 17:15.720
Senior.

17:16.270 --> 17:17.000
You once said

17:17.880 --> 17:19.960
if everyone in the martial world
only strives to be the best

17:19.960 --> 17:21.290
and cannot unite as one,

17:21.680 --> 17:23.480
how will Daxi ever have a future?

17:24.030 --> 17:26.829
The martial world of Daxi
will also cease to exist.

17:26.880 --> 17:27.440
Fine.

17:28.310 --> 17:29.770
I'll listen to you on this.

17:30.070 --> 17:32.730
After all, I've said
all I came here to say today.

17:33.000 --> 17:36.550
It wasn't in vain that I shared a bond
with Tianzheng and Taichan

17:36.680 --> 17:37.720
all these years.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.480
As the top fighter in the martial world,

17:40.480 --> 17:42.310
you're truly deserving of the title.

17:42.310 --> 17:45.240
Even if we only use
Shaolin and Wudang techniques,

17:45.720 --> 17:47.400
we might not be able to win.

17:49.110 --> 17:50.720
You must be Xiao Qiushui.

17:51.720 --> 17:56.120
I've heard that Mr. Xiao's martial skills
and character are both exceptional.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.210
You flatter me, Senior.

17:59.480 --> 18:02.240
The Northern Wasteland
has planted spies in Daxi,

18:02.240 --> 18:03.510
who are causing tragedies

18:03.510 --> 18:05.710
and inciting conflicts between sects.

18:05.720 --> 18:08.070
The Fei family's
Thousand-Faces Mask has been exploited,

18:08.070 --> 18:10.350
and many sects have been implicated.

18:13.270 --> 18:14.920
What Senior Yan said today

18:15.510 --> 18:17.510
is exactly what I've been thinking.

18:18.350 --> 18:21.550
I ask that Wudang and Shaolin
join forces against our enemies.

18:21.550 --> 18:24.720
So you also believe that
Wudang can defeat Shaolin,

18:25.440 --> 18:27.570
and Shaolin can defeat Wudang as well?

18:28.310 --> 18:31.160
Only by mastering the strengths
of the two sects,

18:31.720 --> 18:32.550
using diverse fighting techniques

18:32.550 --> 18:33.790
and knowing the enemy's
advantages and flaws,

18:33.790 --> 18:35.120
can one hope to prevail.

18:35.440 --> 18:36.310
Mr. Xiao,

18:36.480 --> 18:39.550
you're the unanimously chosen
Alliance Leader at the Heroes' Gathering.

18:39.550 --> 18:41.110
You bear the responsibility of
leading the martial world

18:41.110 --> 18:42.960
in rescuing General Wu.

18:43.840 --> 18:44.510
However,

18:44.540 --> 18:46.000
this is not enough to prove

18:46.110 --> 18:48.970
that Shaolin and Wudang
must exchange techniques.

18:50.070 --> 18:53.200
Only if you can use
Shaolin and Wudang Sects' techniques

18:53.640 --> 18:55.240
to take three strikes from us

18:55.480 --> 18:58.550
will Wudang consider your suggestion,
Alliance Leader.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.960
Amitabha.

19:00.110 --> 19:02.000
Shaolin agrees as well.

19:07.030 --> 19:07.720
Qiushui.

19:09.510 --> 19:11.170
If you truly mean what you say,

19:11.390 --> 19:12.520
then show them

19:13.270 --> 19:15.200
that your words are genuine.

19:21.720 --> 19:22.480
Senior Yan.

19:23.110 --> 19:24.110
Must the truth

19:24.550 --> 19:26.070
be proven this way?

19:28.350 --> 19:29.640
Don't you know

19:30.510 --> 19:32.170
that many truths in this world

19:32.430 --> 19:34.720
are established with fists?

19:40.010 --> 19:40.740
Senior Ya...

19:52.000 --> 19:54.880
Please go easy on me, respected seniors.

19:55.070 --> 19:56.830
Young man,
your martial skills are exceptional.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.230
No need for formalities.

20:10.030 --> 20:11.160
These three moves

20:11.250 --> 20:12.690
seem ordinary on their own,

20:12.690 --> 20:15.220
but together
they form a powerful formation.

20:15.310 --> 20:16.110
Xiao Qiushui,

20:16.720 --> 20:18.180
how will you counter this?

20:42.240 --> 20:43.370
The second move now.

20:56.830 --> 20:59.200
Using Wudang's
Nine-Cycle Internal Technique

20:59.200 --> 21:01.110
against Wudang's Celestial Palm,

21:01.110 --> 21:03.070
using softness to overcome hardness.

21:03.070 --> 21:03.730
Brilliant!

21:04.480 --> 21:05.540
The final move now.

21:06.510 --> 21:08.370
If you can't defeat Xiao Qiushui,

21:09.070 --> 21:10.870
you'll be considered defeated.

21:38.310 --> 21:41.710
Five-Finger Heart Connection.
Five petals forming a lotus!

21:44.770 --> 21:47.370
Isn't this just
Shaolin combined with Wudang?

22:03.830 --> 22:04.510
I've lost.

22:05.110 --> 22:07.510
I can't figure out
how to counter this move.

22:09.880 --> 22:10.880
You haven't lost.

22:11.640 --> 22:14.040
We used
the Five-Finger Heart Connection.

22:15.790 --> 22:17.310
This technique
belongs not to Shaolin alone,

22:17.310 --> 22:18.480
nor to Wudang alone.

22:19.110 --> 22:22.840
It's precisely a technique
jointly created by Shaolin and Wudang.

22:24.440 --> 22:26.110
We realized we couldn't defeat you,

22:26.110 --> 22:27.550
so we were forced to use it.

22:27.550 --> 22:28.750
You actually won.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.610
Respected seniors,

22:33.070 --> 22:34.790
your insight is truly remarkable.

22:34.790 --> 22:38.350
Young man, you have a noble heart
and care for the world.

22:38.830 --> 22:40.490
Heroes emerge from the young.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.600
This saying is true indeed.

22:43.070 --> 22:44.350
In today's martial world,

22:44.350 --> 22:46.480
it's you young people who matter most.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.440
We're just a bunch of old bones now.

22:48.440 --> 22:51.300
There's indeed no need for us
to continue fighting.

22:55.070 --> 22:57.880
Seniors, you're being too modest.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.610
What have you learned?

23:07.830 --> 23:08.640
I told you

23:09.480 --> 23:11.280
this journey would benefit you.

23:32.110 --> 23:34.110
I've taken the Herbal King's poison

23:34.270 --> 23:36.720
and will transfer it to Father
using my internal energy.

23:36.720 --> 23:38.720
I wonder if this poison transfer method

23:38.720 --> 23:40.200
will work.

23:55.000 --> 23:55.480
Father!

23:57.310 --> 23:57.830
Father!

24:06.480 --> 24:07.110
Fang.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.070
I'm alright.

24:11.720 --> 24:13.320
Then have some rest, Father.

24:33.290 --> 24:38.990
[Heroes of Our Era]

24:39.110 --> 24:42.000
Back then, Tianzheng, Taichan, and Zhichen

24:43.240 --> 24:45.920
established this stele right here

24:46.270 --> 24:48.270
and created the Hero Command Token.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.110
So this is where

24:50.440 --> 24:53.070
you defeated all those heroes

24:53.310 --> 24:55.840
and obtained the Hero Command Token,
Senior.

24:57.240 --> 24:58.840
With this journey to Wudang,

24:59.200 --> 25:00.730
my wish has been fulfilled.

25:01.110 --> 25:02.460
After I get one more thing done,

25:02.460 --> 25:04.790
I'll return the Hero Command Token to you.

25:10.480 --> 25:11.720
Do you see that thing?

25:18.270 --> 25:20.530
Back when the martial world was in chaos,

25:21.000 --> 25:22.350
I came here specifically

25:22.350 --> 25:23.400
to draw a turtle,

25:23.610 --> 25:26.940
which nearly drove that old man Taichan
to death with anger.

25:29.440 --> 25:30.680
I never thought

25:31.640 --> 25:33.770
you had such a playful spirit, Senior.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.000
Rather than erecting this stele in vain,

25:36.000 --> 25:38.640
it'd be better to show
the so-called heroes of the world

25:38.640 --> 25:41.030
what a bunch of cowards they really are.

25:44.310 --> 25:44.960
By the way,

25:45.680 --> 25:49.540
I heard you formed something called
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

25:50.480 --> 25:51.720
I hope that in the martial world,

25:51.720 --> 25:54.030
someone like you will make a difference.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.270
Perhaps your name

25:57.480 --> 25:59.100
will one day be carved on this stele,

25:59.100 --> 26:00.630
as a true hero.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.640
What I do

26:05.880 --> 26:07.720
is not to make a name for myself

26:08.030 --> 26:09.230
in the martial world.

26:11.880 --> 26:14.010
Just like you did in your time, Senior.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.640
Good lad.

26:17.160 --> 26:17.880
I like that.

26:19.310 --> 26:20.880
The journey in this martial world

26:20.880 --> 26:23.550
is not only about
flamboyant spree and jubilation.

26:23.550 --> 26:25.550
You should live up to justice,

26:25.880 --> 26:27.550
look down without shame to earth,

26:27.550 --> 26:29.200
move in line with righteousness,

26:29.200 --> 26:30.730
and stay true to your heart.

26:33.230 --> 26:34.430
If I can achieve that,

26:35.200 --> 26:37.710
then my journey in this world
will not be in vain.

26:37.710 --> 26:38.510
Well said.

26:39.880 --> 26:43.310
I can say my life hasn't been wasted.

26:46.350 --> 26:48.150
Thank you for your help, Senior.

26:50.310 --> 26:53.710
Now, two streams of internal energy
are colliding within me.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.550
Shaolin and Wudang's martial arts styles

26:55.550 --> 26:58.240
embody opposing principles—
one is hard, the other gentle.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.750
Did you bring me here today

27:00.830 --> 27:02.830
to give me some kind of hint, Senior?

27:03.720 --> 27:04.520
You're smart.

27:06.550 --> 27:08.150
Now that you've realized it,

27:08.310 --> 27:09.440
why not give it a try?

27:14.190 --> 27:16.430
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

27:16.460 --> 27:18.370
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

27:18.400 --> 27:21.630
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

27:22.090 --> 27:23.560
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

27:23.590 --> 27:25.560
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

27:25.590 --> 27:28.790
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

27:28.820 --> 27:30.930
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

27:30.960 --> 27:32.680
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

27:32.700 --> 27:36.170
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

27:36.030 --> 27:36.750
Rather than clashing,

27:36.200 --> 27:37.920
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

27:37.200 --> 27:37.950
it's better to combine forces.

27:37.950 --> 27:39.930
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

27:38.680 --> 27:40.000
Let me give you a helping hand.

27:39.950 --> 27:46.850
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

27:53.670 --> 27:55.670
♪ The violent storms ♪

27:57.450 --> 28:00.170
♪ Thousands of turbid waves ♪

28:00.680 --> 28:02.590
♪ Tread on through till the break of day ♪

28:02.610 --> 28:05.460
♪ I'm ready to go with you ♪

28:05.490 --> 28:07.740
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

28:07.760 --> 28:09.470
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

28:09.570 --> 28:12.790
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

28:13.260 --> 28:14.730
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

28:14.750 --> 28:16.730
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

28:16.750 --> 28:19.960
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

28:19.980 --> 28:21.790
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

28:21.810 --> 28:23.530
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

28:23.550 --> 28:27.030
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

28:27.360 --> 28:28.890
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

28:28.920 --> 28:30.900
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

28:30.920 --> 28:37.820
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

28:49.680 --> 28:50.340
Senior Yan.

29:14.750 --> 29:15.340
Father.

29:20.440 --> 29:20.960
Father!

29:42.020 --> 29:42.660
Tang Song.

29:43.310 --> 29:44.440
Shouldn't you be...

29:44.640 --> 29:45.420
Fang.

29:46.350 --> 29:49.000
I heard you worked really hard
to treat your father,

29:49.000 --> 29:50.780
so I came specially to check on him.

29:50.780 --> 29:52.910
Why are you so cold?

29:53.400 --> 29:54.940
What do you want to do to my father?

29:54.940 --> 29:55.580
Let him go!

29:57.200 --> 29:58.660
Fang, don't get worked up.

29:59.000 --> 30:00.840
The poison is already clouding your mind.

30:00.840 --> 30:02.160
If your anger flares again,

30:02.160 --> 30:04.090
I fear you may spiral into madness.

30:07.960 --> 30:08.550
Fang.

30:08.830 --> 30:10.030
Don't worry about me!

30:10.960 --> 30:11.640
Tang Song.

30:12.390 --> 30:13.790
How dare you hurt Master?

30:14.050 --> 30:16.850
Aren't you worried
Old Madam Tang will punish you?

30:17.830 --> 30:18.680
You don't actually think

30:18.680 --> 30:21.010
I'm afraid of that dying old woman,
do you?

30:21.720 --> 30:22.520
Rest assured.

30:22.830 --> 30:26.110
I'll deal with her sooner or later.

30:26.750 --> 30:28.880
I'll handle you all

30:29.550 --> 30:30.480
one by one.

30:31.790 --> 30:33.310
Without your father,

30:33.790 --> 30:35.240
you could be free

30:35.680 --> 30:36.750
and unrestrained,

30:37.310 --> 30:39.000
and you could focus on cultivation

30:39.000 --> 30:40.260
to master your skills.

30:40.920 --> 30:41.590
Am I right?

30:49.590 --> 30:50.480
Father!

31:03.000 --> 31:03.590
Father!

31:06.110 --> 31:06.880
Fang.

31:08.920 --> 31:09.960
I'll no longer

31:12.310 --> 31:15.110
be a burden to you.

31:17.170 --> 31:23.960
You must live well.

31:37.230 --> 31:39.640
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

31:40.500 --> 31:43.270
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

31:43.590 --> 31:44.350
Father!

31:44.890 --> 31:48.050
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

31:48.400 --> 31:49.110
Father!

31:48.400 --> 31:52.800
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

31:52.110 --> 31:52.830
Father!

31:53.650 --> 31:57.050
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

31:54.240 --> 31:55.350
No!

31:57.430 --> 32:00.800
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

32:00.080 --> 32:00.950
Father!

32:01.730 --> 32:04.550
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

32:04.580 --> 32:09.270
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

32:09.000 --> 32:10.590
I'm sorry, Father.

32:09.330 --> 32:11.330
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

32:11.350 --> 32:13.350
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

32:13.560 --> 32:16.300
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

32:16.890 --> 32:19.120
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

32:19.140 --> 32:24.490
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

32:24.960 --> 32:26.270
Your mind is in a mess.

32:25.340 --> 32:27.400
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

32:27.000 --> 32:28.590
It's the perfect time to take control.

32:27.420 --> 32:29.420
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

32:29.560 --> 32:32.700
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

32:32.950 --> 32:35.250
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

32:33.790 --> 32:34.920
Tang Song.

32:35.340 --> 32:39.450
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

32:36.960 --> 32:38.440
I'll kill you!

32:51.090 --> 32:52.090
Fang.

32:53.550 --> 32:54.790
Fang.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.600
I'm here.

32:59.760 --> 33:01.280
Be good, Fang.

33:02.910 --> 33:04.940
From today on,

33:06.240 --> 33:08.680
you must listen to your cousin.

33:09.830 --> 33:11.310
Understand?

33:15.830 --> 33:18.400
Now, kill him for me.

33:35.070 --> 33:36.310
How dare you!

33:36.590 --> 33:37.720
I'm still alive.

33:38.000 --> 33:40.260
What are you trying to do, you scoundrel?

33:48.130 --> 33:50.960
I'll eliminate you menace today!

34:02.000 --> 34:02.590
You...

34:04.030 --> 34:05.440
What trickery is this?

34:05.920 --> 34:06.830
Old hag.

34:07.830 --> 34:11.030
I already poisoned you with
the Bone-Softening Incense.

34:12.340 --> 34:15.670
The poison activates as soon as
you use your martial skills.

34:16.320 --> 34:17.650
You wretched creature!

34:18.000 --> 34:20.590
How dare you betray your master
and defy your lineage!

34:20.590 --> 34:21.590
Elder Chijie.

34:21.760 --> 34:22.070
Yes.

34:22.070 --> 34:23.710
Seize him for me!

34:23.880 --> 34:24.360
Yes!

34:38.290 --> 34:39.290
You old fossil.

34:40.610 --> 34:43.070
You've controlled
the Tang Sect for decades.

34:43.070 --> 34:44.730
Stuck in your old ways all day.

34:45.440 --> 34:47.370
Since you lack the ability to lead,

34:47.389 --> 34:50.250
you might as well hand over
the Tang Sect Token to me.

34:50.760 --> 34:52.560
I'll make the Tang Sect prosper.

35:08.150 --> 35:09.680
Get the Tang Sect Token now.

35:33.400 --> 35:35.190
Mere Bone-Softening Incense.

35:36.000 --> 35:38.600
Don't think you can take me down
just like that.

35:39.000 --> 35:39.630
No way.

35:40.230 --> 35:41.090
How can this be?

35:41.270 --> 35:42.150
Seize her now!

36:41.800 --> 36:42.530
Don't worry.

36:59.920 --> 37:00.670
Where am I?

37:00.690 --> 37:02.190
Mr. Yan, please don't move.

37:02.190 --> 37:04.230
You suddenly collapsed at Wudang Square.

37:04.230 --> 37:06.130
I guess your old illness flared up,

37:06.130 --> 37:08.030
so I brought you back for treatment.

37:08.030 --> 37:09.630
How are you feeling now?

37:11.590 --> 37:12.230
Who is she?

37:14.030 --> 37:16.030
This is my older sister, Xiao Xueyu.

37:19.730 --> 37:20.370
Xueyu.

37:21.230 --> 37:23.160
How's Senior Yan's condition now?

37:24.400 --> 37:25.800
A nail was thrust into
the back of Mr. Yan's neck,

37:25.800 --> 37:27.800
driven with profound internal energy,

37:27.800 --> 37:29.200
reaching his meridians.

37:29.360 --> 37:30.960
Normally he only feels pain,

37:31.440 --> 37:33.900
but now it has affected
multiple meridians.

37:34.230 --> 37:36.800
Ordinary treatment can only address
the symptoms, not the root of the problem.

37:36.800 --> 37:38.200
Only by removing the nail

37:38.550 --> 37:40.810
can we completely eliminate the danger.

37:43.070 --> 37:46.600
This is all the doing of
that venomous scoundrel from Tang Sect.

37:48.070 --> 37:48.800
Senior.

37:53.440 --> 37:55.170
I've roamed the martial world,

37:55.630 --> 37:57.030
unrivaled under heaven,

37:57.400 --> 37:59.230
and few could ever harm me.

38:01.030 --> 38:03.760
Yet in that battle at Wuxing Mountain,

38:04.440 --> 38:07.500
Tang Yaoshun ambushed me
with the Soul-Piercing Nail.

38:08.360 --> 38:11.230
His skills are formidable.

38:12.760 --> 38:13.550
Senior,

38:14.330 --> 38:16.640
I'm willing to help you remove this nail.

38:20.210 --> 38:21.490
I've already given you

38:21.510 --> 38:23.760
the Agarwood Energy-Harmonizing Pill.

38:23.760 --> 38:25.490
The medicine has taken effect.

38:25.590 --> 38:27.760
Your vital energy should be balanced now.

38:27.760 --> 38:28.360
Senior,

38:29.070 --> 38:30.730
you might as well give it a try.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.230
Senior.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.330
Qiushui.

38:58.590 --> 38:59.960
Then I'll trouble you with this.

38:59.960 --> 39:00.550
Alright.

39:03.080 --> 39:04.520
Senior, pardon me.

39:16.880 --> 39:18.120
It's fine. Continue.

39:18.630 --> 39:19.690
Pardon me, Senior.

39:47.030 --> 39:47.630
Senior.

39:48.230 --> 39:51.630
This Soul-Piercing Nail actually fused
our internal energies together,

39:51.630 --> 39:54.560
and the nail only goes deeper
when I try to pull it out.

39:57.230 --> 39:58.030
Let it be.

39:59.150 --> 40:01.150
This nail has been with me for years.

40:01.400 --> 40:03.360
It has already grown into my marrow.

40:03.360 --> 40:04.290
If we leave it in,

40:04.920 --> 40:06.580
I'll just feel dizzy and weak.

40:06.590 --> 40:08.250
Some rest will take care of it.

40:08.440 --> 40:10.040
If we really try to remove it,

40:10.070 --> 40:11.710
it might cost me my life.

40:12.320 --> 40:13.520
Senior, don't worry.

40:13.920 --> 40:15.920
I'm sure I can find a solution.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.480
Whatever you do,
don't go to the Tang Sect.

40:17.480 --> 40:19.610
I'd rather die than accept their help.

40:20.760 --> 40:21.400
Qiushui,

40:21.800 --> 40:22.860
let's step outside

40:23.070 --> 40:24.530
so that Senior could rest.

40:27.230 --> 40:27.800
Okay.

41:14.920 --> 41:15.550
Tang Fang.

41:18.070 --> 41:19.000
Pour me some tea.

41:40.230 --> 41:41.880
This puppet-control needle

41:42.670 --> 41:43.760
works so well.

41:54.440 --> 41:55.110
Tang Fang.

41:56.800 --> 41:59.660
Those precious hidden weapons
and poisons of yours

42:00.030 --> 42:02.480
and all those things
Old Madam Tang gave you

42:02.960 --> 42:04.960
are of no use to you now.

42:05.360 --> 42:07.220
Why don't you hand them over to me?

42:13.710 --> 42:16.710
You've always had all the good stuff
since childhood.

42:18.360 --> 42:19.490
Didn't expect this,

42:20.440 --> 42:21.710
did you?

42:25.230 --> 42:26.110
Stop fooling around.
